2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:03,280
The match between Champion Nankatsu and Toho Academy,

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,280
in the finals of the National Middle School Football Tournament,

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:09,150
goes into extra time with a 3-3 score!

5
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:12,160
Extra time will consist of two halves of 10 minutes each.

6
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,650
If the match still does not reach a conclusion after this,

7
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:17,280
both teams will be declared winners.

8
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,880
Nankatsu's Captain Ozora Tsubasa-kun,

9
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,650
will play in the extra time despite the injuries on his body.

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,790
This half will start with Nankatsu's kick-off.

11
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:29,010
I relied too much on the Drive Shot in this match.

12
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:32,370
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

13
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:32,370
I only thought about scoring with the Drive Shot.

14
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:36,550
It shows that I still rely on Roberto excessively.

15
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:38,390
Not just Roberto.

16
00:00:38,390 --> 00:00:45,600
Misaki-kun, Wakabayashi-kun, Ishizaki-kun, Nankatsu Eleven and the Manager...

17
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,600
Fight!

18
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,600
Don't lose!

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:49,360
Fight! Fight! Nankatsu!

20
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:49,360
Thanks to their help, I've come this far.

21
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,600
But after this, I'll be alone...

22
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,350
After completing my 3rd championship in the tournament,

23
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:56,740
when I go to Brazil, I'll be alone.

24
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,920
Thank you, everyone.

25
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,870
Thank you for everything up until now.

26
00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:04,910
I, 15-year-old Tsubasa Ozora, will score my last goal in Japan

27
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:07,960
and start my journey.

28
