00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:43,260
EPISODE 51:
MIRACLE DRIVE SHOT!

68
00:02:38,410 --> 00:02:40,390
Extra time has begun!

69
00:02:40,390 --> 00:02:44,100
Tsubasa-kun dribbles alone in Toho's half.

70
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,420
Tsubasa must be too tired to move.

71
00:02:46,420 --> 00:02:47,850
We'll crush him!

72
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:50,730
What?!

73
00:02:50,730 --> 00:02:52,660
He got past both of them at once!

74
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:55,940
Tsubasa-san still has strength inside him.

75
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,190
Eat this!

76
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:59,950
Tsubasa-kun jumps and dodges before they do!

77
00:03:00,620 --> 00:03:01,700
Tsubasa!

78
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:04,670
Tsubasa, are you immortal or something?!

79
00:03:04,670 --> 00:03:07,500
How can you still jump like this?!

80
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:08,910
Tsubasa-san!

81
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:10,160
I'll take the ball!

82
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:16,380
Tsubasa-kun blocked the ball tightly with both legs!

83
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:20,130
I won't give it back until I score!

84
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,760
I'll never give it!

85
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:24,140
Stop! Stop Tsubasa!

86
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:27,770
Damn it, it's starting again.

87
00:03:27,770 --> 00:03:32,850
It seems my body is truly reaching its limit...

88
00:03:33,370 --> 00:03:36,810
But... I must turn this into a goal.

89
00:03:36,810 --> 00:03:39,280
I will score my farewell goal!

90
00:03:41,850 --> 00:03:44,230
Great! What a great technique he has!

91
00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:45,240
Tsubasa!

92
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,280
Tsubasa...!

93
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,580
Tsubasa-kun!

94
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:49,040
It's very similar.

95
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:55,330
When Tsubasa moved to Nankatsu City, his only friend was football.

96
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:56,540
It's very similar...

97
00:03:56,540 --> 00:04:02,510
It's very similar to when he beat Shutetsu and his friend all alone...

98
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,220
Tsubasa!

99
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:07,760
We'll stop him!

100
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:11,350
Despite all his injuries,

101
00:04:11,350 --> 00:04:14,090
his extraordinary football sense is not dulled!

102
00:04:14,090 --> 00:04:17,640
A multi-talented player of superior ability!

103
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:21,610
The Prodigal Son of Football, Ozora Tsubasa-kun!

104
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:26,120
He finally managed to get past all of Toho's defenders.

105
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,100
Goal...

106
00:04:29,100 --> 00:04:30,790
I can see the goal.

107
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:32,500
I will definitely make this shot!

108
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:38,000
However, Hyuga-kun saw his intention and stayed back!

109
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,310
Here I come, Tsubasa!

110
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:40,250
Bring it on!

111
00:04:41,090 --> 00:04:43,830
Will Tsubasa-kun shoot, or will Hyuga-kun stop him first?

112
00:04:43,830 --> 00:04:44,800
Which one will happen?

113
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:49,940
Sliding Tiger Shot!

114
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:49,940
Sliding Tiger Shot

115
00:04:49,940 --> 00:04:52,540
Hyuga-kun was a moment faster!

116
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:53,980
Tsubasa-kun cannot strike the ball!

117
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,350
What?!

118
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,610
Tsubasa...

119
00:05:00,650 --> 00:05:03,300
Ishizaki-kun...

120
00:05:03,300 --> 00:05:04,790
I...

121
00:05:04,790 --> 00:05:06,990
We...

122
00:05:06,990 --> 00:05:09,510
Aren't we your friends, TSUBASA?!

123
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:11,370
Aren't we your friends, TSUBASA?!

124
00:05:11,370 --> 00:05:12,660
He's right, Tsubasa!

125
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:13,930
You're not alone!

126
00:05:13,930 --> 00:05:15,690
We're right behind you!

127
00:05:15,690 --> 00:05:18,420
Take it, Tsubasa!

128
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:19,840
Ishizaki-kun...

129
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:21,130
Everyone...

130
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:23,170
My friends...

131
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:29,100
I will convert Ishizaki-kun's and everyone's pass...

132
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,180
Tsubasa!

133
00:05:31,780 --> 00:05:34,040
They will definitely stay with me...

134
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,180
My friends are with me.

135
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,400
I'm not alone!

136
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:40,820
And when I go to Brazil, I won't be alone!

137
00:05:40,820 --> 00:05:42,730
We trust you, Tsubasa!

138
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:47,240
They're always supporting me from behind!

139
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:53,450
His preparation for the Drive Shot and the pass are perfectly synchronized!

140
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:53,450
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

141
00:05:53,450 --> 00:05:54,830
I challenge you, Tsubasa!

142
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:57,870
He's not using his leg the same way he always does for the Drive Shot.

143
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:57,870
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

144
00:05:57,870 --> 00:06:00,920
This is my last shot in Japan!

145
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:08,680
Here is my farewell goal!

146
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,510
I'll stop it!

147
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:10,890
Even if only with my right hand...!

148
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,350
I-It's bouncing!

149
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:24,490
I-It's in!

150
00:06:24,490 --> 00:06:26,600
In the first minute of extra time!

151
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:30,410
With Tsubasa-kun's goal, Nankatsu has finally made a comeback!

152
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,920
I did it!

153
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,830
I scored!

154
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:34,770
You did it!

155
00:06:34,770 --> 00:06:36,290
You did it, Tsubasa!

156
00:06:36,290 --> 00:06:39,120
Nankatsu eleven are happily hugging each other!

157
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,680
Score 4-3.

158
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:44,880
Nankatsu surpasses Toho by one goal for the first time in this match.

159
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:47,590
It truly was a magnificent shot.

160
00:06:47,590 --> 00:06:52,470
The shot bounced off the ground and its violent spin threw it in the opposite direction.

161
00:06:52,470 --> 00:06:54,640
It fiercely tore through the side net!

162
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:58,140
This was probably a different version of the Drive Shot.

163
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:58,140
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

164
00:06:56,330 --> 00:06:58,140
Tsubasa, you're the best!

165
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:03,130
A Miracle Drive Shot that only Tsubasa-kun can perform!

166
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:03,130
Miracle Drive Shot

167
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:08,130
Despite all his injuries, he scored his 4th goal in this match.

168
00:07:08,130 --> 00:07:09,720
Truly amazing!

169
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:13,780
The football genius born in Japan, Ozora Tsubasa-kun!

170
00:07:13,780 --> 00:07:15,350
You did it, Tsubasa!

171
00:07:15,350 --> 00:07:17,980
We're finally ahead by one goal!

172
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:20,790
We're one step closer to our dream, aren't we?

173
00:07:20,790 --> 00:07:23,730
To our dream...

174
00:07:23,730 --> 00:07:24,500
Tsubasa?

175
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:26,120
Tsubasa!

176
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,050
Tsubasa?!

177
00:07:27,050 --> 00:07:28,180
Tsubasa!

178
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:28,850
Tsubasa!

179
00:07:28,850 --> 00:07:29,990
Tsubasa!

180
00:07:29,990 --> 00:07:31,300
Tsubasa!!!

181
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,040
You finally opened your eyes, Tsubasa-kun!

182
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,060
Tsubasa-senpai!

183
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:44,310
Where am I?

184
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:45,850
Infirmary.

185
00:07:46,970 --> 00:07:48,040
And the match?!

186
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,900
How is Nankatsu?

187
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:50,780
How are my friends?!

188
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:51,730
Tsubasa-kun.

189
00:07:51,730 --> 00:07:52,920
Senpai!

190
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,860
Stay still for a while!

191
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,950
Extra time is still being played.

192
00:07:58,370 --> 00:08:02,370
I finally fainted, didn't I?

193
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:03,780
Yes.

194
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,630
But you scored, senpai.

195
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,840
Our comeback goal.

196
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:10,340
Yes, that beautiful final goal.

197
00:08:13,890 --> 00:08:14,840
Tsubasa!

198
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,200
Go, Toho!

199
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:16,850
Attack!

200
00:08:16,850 --> 00:08:17,970
Sorimachi-san!

201
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,410
Nankatsu is desperately defending!

202
00:08:23,410 --> 00:08:26,560
However, Captain Ozara Tsubasa-kun is not on the field.

203
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:29,280
Big brother, why aren't you attacking?

204
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:32,630
If you strike now, you can score.

205
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:33,950
Kojiro...

206
00:08:33,950 --> 00:08:34,880
Everyone...

207
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:35,950
4-3.

208
00:08:35,950 --> 00:08:36,700
Ah!

209
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:40,080
Coach, is it still the first half of extra time?

210
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,570
Tsubasa!

211
00:08:41,570 --> 00:08:43,870
Coach! Let me return to the field!

212
00:08:43,870 --> 00:08:44,730
I refuse.

213
00:08:44,730 --> 00:08:45,790
You can't!

214
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:48,340
Don't tell me someone was substituted in my place.

215
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,520
It's fine.

216
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,550
We didn't sub anyone in your place.

217
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:54,760
They said they would protect this goal together.

218
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:59,600
Tsubasa fainted because we burdened him too much.

219
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:03,140
It doesn't matter whether he comes back or not.

220
00:09:03,140 --> 00:09:06,520
We will defend the first half of extra time ourselves.

221
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:10,730
We will protect the single goal he gave us as ten players!

222
00:09:10,730 --> 00:09:13,140
That's why we beg you, coach!

223
00:09:13,140 --> 00:09:15,990
They asked this of the coach.

224
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:17,820
Everyone...

225
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:22,130
However, I can no longer allow you to overuse your body.

226
00:09:22,130 --> 00:09:23,000
Huh?!

227
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,210
I plan to have Yamamori play in the second half.

228
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:28,760
I thought you promised me, Tsubasa.

229
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:31,820
If you fainted, you would be immediately withdrawn from the game.

230
00:09:31,820 --> 00:09:33,050
But Doctor...!

231
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:36,170
Why do you push yourself so hard for the fight?!

232
00:09:36,170 --> 00:09:39,360
Your real dream is not Nankatsu's 3rd championship!

233
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:43,270
It was to go to Brazil and become the world's best football player!

234
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:50,040
For the sake of the big dream that I cannot afford to lose.

235
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:53,610
I have to fight and win.

236
00:09:53,610 --> 00:09:57,360
I'll take all the responsibility.

237
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:00,020
I don't care if I die in this match.

238
00:10:00,020 --> 00:10:03,530
If Tsubasa Ozora is a person who will get exhausted here,

239
00:10:03,530 --> 00:10:06,900
then the dreams of going to Brazil, making Japan number 1 in the world,

240
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:09,340
and becoming the world's best football player....

241
00:10:09,340 --> 00:10:13,630
None of these dreams could have come true in the first place!

242
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,010
Please, let him play.

243
00:10:18,770 --> 00:10:22,100
Before winning and losing,

244
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:25,430
not being able to play football is the hardest thing for Tsubasa-kun.

245
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:29,890
Please don't take football away from Tsubasa-kun...

246
00:10:31,610 --> 00:10:33,150
Manager...

247
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:38,280
As if I'll let you shoot!

248
00:10:40,420 --> 00:10:42,420
Nice play, Ishizaki-kun.

249
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:45,980
Everyone, good defense.

250
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:49,330
Everyone! I... I will play!

251
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:50,830
Tsubasa!

252
00:10:50,830 --> 00:10:51,700
Tsubasa!

253
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:52,320
That's Tsubasa!

254
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:55,540
Ozora Tsubasa-kun, who was previously taken off the field due to injury,

255
00:10:55,540 --> 00:10:58,760
appeared in front of the substitute bench.

256
00:10:56,370 --> 00:10:57,880
Tsubasa is back!

257
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,760
Tsubasa!

258
00:11:01,050 --> 00:11:03,760
The cleared ball goes to Hyuga-kun.

259
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:04,810
Stop him!

260
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:07,100
He can easily score with a Tiger Shot from there!

261
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:07,100
Tiger Shot

262
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,350
What?!

263
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:16,570
Hyuga-kun...

264
00:11:16,570 --> 00:11:18,420
Tsubasa...

265
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:25,930
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

266
00:11:31,620 --> 00:11:33,140
Hyuga...

267
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:36,250
He sent the ball out so Tsubasa could re-enter the field.

268
00:11:36,250 --> 00:11:39,090
Tsubasa-kun is returning to the field!

