00:17:30,150 --> 00:17:32,960
Mr. Principal, I feel satisfied with the struggles so far in the final match.

405
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:35,760
Mr. Principal, I feel satisfied with the struggles so far in the final match.

406
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:41,790
Whatever the result, I am proud of the students.

